export anchor EInkStyle:
    number: 165
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: E-ink
    idea: The dashboard reads like an open e-reader, with grey electronic paper, crisp black serif type and no colour at all, set as a two-page spread with chapter tabs and page-turn controls.
    base: light
    palette:
        desk: #d9d8d3, the page behind the device
        bezel: #f4f4f1, the device frame and field fills
        ePaper: #e8e7e1, the screen and the style sheet
        ink: #111111, type, rules, solid bars and every status
        softInk: #4a4a47, meta, running heads and folios
        rule: #9a9993, hairlines and borders, never text
        tint: #cfcec8, highlights, the gutter shade and meter ticks
    type:
        Text uses Charter, Bitstream Charter, Sitka Text, Cambria, Georgia,
        serif. The greeting is 40px regular, total figures 34px tabular,
        project names 21px, body 18px at 1.6 and meta 15px italic. Small
        caps style labels and the status bar use system-ui at 12 to 14px,
        section heads 13px caps tracked 0.2em between em dashes, and
        status words 13px bold caps.
    layout:
        A light rounded device frame holds a flat e-paper screen. A thin
        status bar carries the brand, a pill search field, a black New
        project button, a round bell and an initials disc with Mara Okafor.
        Below it the nav is a row of numbered chapter tabs, 1 Home to 6
        Settings, with the current one underlined in black. The body is a
        book spread split by a soft grey gutter. The left page has a
        running head, the greeting and date in italic, the overdue line
        between two thick rules, a two by two table of the four totals and
        the six projects as numbered entries with status at right, meta in
        italic and a thin ticked meter. The right page has the chart and
        Recent highlights with grey marker highlights on task names. Each
        page ends in a folio number. A page-turn bar at the bottom shows
        previous Settings, Home 1 of 6 with six dots, and next Projects.
        Below 900px the spread becomes one page and the search wraps under
        the brand.
    spacing: An 8px unit. Book margins of 40 to 56px, 14px between entries, 32px before section heads.
    density: Calm and bookish, with long lines of prose and one column per page.
    corners: Square pages. Only the 22px device frame, the search pill, avatar and bell are round.
    borders: 1px ink under the status bar and above the page-turn bar, 2px ink rules round the overdue line, grey hairlines between entries, dotted rules between highlights.
    shadows: None. A soft grey gradient down the gutter is the only depth.
    icons:
        Black only. A filled circle for On track, a hollow triangle for At
        risk, a filled square for Behind and a crossed box for Overdue,
        each beside its word. In the chart last week is diagonally hatched
        and this week is solid black.
    focus: A 3px ink outline offset 3px with a paper gap and a second 2px ink ring outside.
    tone: A book's voice, such as Chapter one, Recent highlights and Home 1 of 6.
